properties.note:
Answers the finding at its class:
- a held store is retried with bounded backoff (0.5 s to 5 s) and served in place by the same process, on stdio and --http;
- a --shared session whose election timed out re-elects and switches in place;
- causes that cannot clear are not polled;
- /readyz answers 200 only while the design is served, and the image's HEALTHCHECK probes it.
Measured in containers on one volume: 503 while the old container held the store, 200 about 1 s after it stopped, with no restart. The 2026-09-14 latent-surface finding, the other member of this class, was already answered by its own same-day fix (in-place promotion on every call), so no INVALIDATES is drawn to it from here.
